{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187580/extras/steam_store1.gif?t=1739599420\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">XxXxXxXxD[STORY]XxXxXxXxD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious objects suddenly and simultaneously appearing all over the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unknown spaces and strange creatures spreading out there</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere along the way, a special resource was said to be available from these creatures, called <strong>HEX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever there is a whiff of money, there is always an underworld</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this dangerous city, a teenager named \u201cLea\u201cInvolved in the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lust? or warfare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you deal with <strong>HEX</strong> will have a big impact on the rest of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187580/extras/HEX202410271752-exporta.gif?t=1739599420\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">XxXxXxXxD[BATTLE]XxXxXxXxD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you dive into a dungeon, fighting is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect more materials than you need and create items at the various mixing stations scattered throughout the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items work and some don't, depending on the monster you are facing, so keep repeating trial and error to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187580/extras/HEX202410271741-export.gif?t=1739599420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">XxXxXxXxD[ACTIONS]XxXxXxXxD</h2><p class=\"